# ABLETON BRAIN - MCP Implementation Guide

**Full AI-powered Ableton Live control with VST/AU plugin management, sample scanning, and automatic tune generation.**

---

## 🎯 What This Does

| Feature | Status |
|---------|--------|
| **Complete Ableton Control** | ✅ Tracks, clips, devices, transport, arrangement |
| **VST/AU Plugin Control** | ✅ Parameter enumeration, Serum deep control, automation |
| **Sample Scanning** | ✅ Auto-detects role, BPM, key, genre from folder |
| **Auto Tune Generation** | ✅ Builds full track from samples (drums, bass, loops, scenes) |
| **MCP Protocol** | ✅ Works with Claude, Cursor, any MCP client |
| **Max for Live Fallback** | ✅ For browser operations & deep VST control |

---

## 📁 New Files Added

```
ableton-brain/
├── ableton_remote/
│   └── __init__.py          # Remote Script (installs in Ableton)
├── mcp_server.py            # MCP Server (external Python)
├── sample_scanner.py        # Sample analysis & tune generation
├── install.bat              # Windows installer
├── database.json            # Artist/technique database
├── samples/                 # Put your samples here
